{"name":"Correspondence","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/correspondence.png","system":{"description":"<p>Correspondence opened space to you before anything else, and space has never closed again.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Correspondence rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Correspondence works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Correspondence effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><ul><li>The difficulty to hit you increases by <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</li><li>Anyone targeting you finds you slightly displaced.</li></ul><h3>Range</h3><p>When <strong>Correspondence</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Range</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Correspondence rating and the Scope level, and Range does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-correspondence","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"7"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-correspondence"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"correspondence","intro":"Correspondence opened space to you before anything else, and space has never closed again.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Correspondence rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Correspondence works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Correspondence effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<ul><li>The difficulty to hit you increases by <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</li><li>Anyone targeting you finds you slightly displaced.</li></ul>"},{"id":"range","label":"Range","kind":"scope","description":"<p>When <strong>Correspondence</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Range</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Correspondence rating and the Scope level, and Range does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereCorr01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Entropy","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/entropy.png","system":{"description":"<p>Entropy first taught you that things give way, and ever since they also give way when you need them to.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Entropy rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Entropy works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Entropy effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><ul><li>Once per turn, force an opponent who rolled against you to reroll with <strong>-2 dice</strong>, or reroll one of your own non-Magick defensive rolls with <strong>+2 dice</strong>.</li><li>This refreshes at the beginning of your turn.</li></ul><h3>Conditions</h3><p>When <strong>Entropy</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Conditions</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Entropy rating and the Scope level, and Conditions does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-entropy","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"14"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-entropy"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"entropy","intro":"Entropy first taught you that things give way, and ever since they also give way when you need them to.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Entropy rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Entropy works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Entropy effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<ul><li>Once per turn, force an opponent who rolled against you to reroll with <strong>-2 dice</strong>, or reroll one of your own non-Magick defensive rolls with <strong>+2 dice</strong>.</li><li>This refreshes at the beginning of your turn.</li></ul>"},{"id":"conditions","label":"Conditions","kind":"scope","description":"<p>When <strong>Entropy</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Conditions</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Entropy rating and the Scope level, and Conditions does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereEntr01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Forces","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/forces.png","system":{"description":"<p>Forces called to you through a storm or a candle, and ever since energy has recognized you.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Forces rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Forces works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Forces effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong>; Forces effects always inflict physical damage.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p><strong>Reduce damage</strong> from any blow by <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller according to how you resist it.</p><h3>Potency</h3><p>When <strong>Forces</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Potency</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Forces rating and the Scope level, and Potency does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-forces","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"21"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-forces"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"forces","intro":"Forces called to you through a storm or a candle, and ever since energy has recognized you.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Forces rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Forces works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Forces effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong>; Forces effects always inflict physical damage.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p><strong>Reduce damage</strong> from any blow by <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller according to how you resist it.</p>"},{"id":"potency","label":"Potency","kind":"scope","description":"<p>When <strong>Forces</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Potency</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Forces rating and the Scope level, and Potency does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereForc01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Life","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/life.png","system":{"description":"<p>Life called to you first through beasts or bodies, and ever since your flesh has argued back.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Life rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Life works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Life effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong>; Life effects always inflict physical damage.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><ul><li>When you suffer physical damage, roll <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong> to soak it.</li><li>Each success absorbs one Superficial damage; every two absorb one Aggravated.</li><li>Spending <strong>1 Quintessence</strong> makes each success absorb two Superficial or one Aggravated.</li></ul><h3>Health</h3><ul><li><strong>Regenerate physical Health damage equal to Arete each turn</strong>.</li><li>You resist disease and poison and can heal unnatural wounds.</li><li>Spending Quintessence also restores physical Aggravated damage and missing body parts.</li></ul>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-life","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"63"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-life"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"life","intro":"Life called to you first through beasts or bodies, and ever since your flesh has argued back.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Life rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Life works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Life effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong>; Life effects always inflict physical damage.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<ul><li>When you suffer physical damage, roll <strong>Arete plus Stamina</strong> to soak it.</li><li>Each success absorbs one Superficial damage; every two absorb one Aggravated.</li><li>Spending <strong>1 Quintessence</strong> makes each success absorb two Superficial or one Aggravated.</li></ul>"},{"id":"health","label":"Health","kind":"track","description":"<ul><li><strong>Regenerate physical Health damage equal to Arete each turn</strong>.</li><li>You resist disease and poison and can heal unnatural wounds.</li><li>Spending Quintessence also restores physical Aggravated damage and missing body parts.</li></ul>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereLife01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Matter","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/matter.png","system":{"description":"<p>Matter first showed you what things are made of, and ever since things have stood on your side.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Matter rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Matter works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Matter effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><ul><li>You have <strong>armor dice equal to your Sphere rating plus Arete</strong>.</li><li>They are tied to an object in your hand capable of parrying the blow, and break as the object breaks.</li></ul><h3>Area</h3><p>When <strong>Matter</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Area</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Matter rating and the Scope level, and Area does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-matter","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"28"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-matter"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"matter","intro":"Matter first showed you what things are made of, and ever since things have stood on your side.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Matter rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Matter works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Matter effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<ul><li>You have <strong>armor dice equal to your Sphere rating plus Arete</strong>.</li><li>They are tied to an object in your hand capable of parrying the blow, and break as the object breaks.</li></ul>"},{"id":"area","label":"Area","kind":"scope","description":"<p>When <strong>Matter</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Area</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Matter rating and the Scope level, and Area does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereMatt01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Mind","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/mind.png","system":{"description":"<p>Mind first opened the door of thought to you, and ever since yours has been a locked room.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Mind rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Mind works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Mind effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Resolve</strong>; Mind effects always inflict mental damage.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><ul><li>When you suffer mental damage, roll <strong>Arete plus Resolve</strong> to soak it.</li><li>Each success absorbs one Superficial damage; every two absorb one Aggravated.</li><li>Spending <strong>1 Quintessence</strong> improves absorption.</li><li>Damage caused by rerolling dice cannot be soaked this way.</li></ul><h3>Mental Health</h3><ul><li><strong>Regenerate mental Health damage equal to Arete each turn</strong>.</li><li>Spending Quintessence also restores mental Aggravated damage and lost memories.</li></ul>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-mind","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"35"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-mind"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"mind","intro":"Mind first opened the door of thought to you, and ever since yours has been a locked room.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Mind rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Mind works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Mind effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus Resolve</strong>; Mind effects always inflict mental damage.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<ul><li>When you suffer mental damage, roll <strong>Arete plus Resolve</strong> to soak it.</li><li>Each success absorbs one Superficial damage; every two absorb one Aggravated.</li><li>Spending <strong>1 Quintessence</strong> improves absorption.</li><li>Damage caused by rerolling dice cannot be soaked this way.</li></ul>"},{"id":"willpower","label":"Mental Health","kind":"track","description":"<ul><li><strong>Regenerate mental Health damage equal to Arete each turn</strong>.</li><li>Spending Quintessence also restores mental Aggravated damage and lost memories.</li></ul>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereMind01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Prime","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/prime.png","system":{"description":"<p>Prime first showed you what everything else is made of, and ever since your spark has burned from within.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Prime rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Prime works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Prime effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><ul><li><strong>Reduce the successes</strong> of a power or Magick effect cast on you by rolling the same Attribute and Ability pool used by its caster.</li><li>If it falls below the threshold, the effect is nullified.</li><li>Once per turn.</li></ul><h3>Targets</h3><p>When <strong>Prime</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Targets</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Prime rating and the Scope level, and Targets does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-prime","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"42"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-prime"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"prime","intro":"Prime first showed you what everything else is made of, and ever since your spark has burned from within.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Prime rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Prime works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Prime effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<ul><li><strong>Reduce the successes</strong> of a power or Magick effect cast on you by rolling the same Attribute and Ability pool used by its caster.</li><li>If it falls below the threshold, the effect is nullified.</li><li>Once per turn.</li></ul>"},{"id":"targets","label":"Targets","kind":"scope","description":"<p>When <strong>Prime</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Targets</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Prime rating and the Scope level, and Targets does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSpherePrim01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Spirit","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/spirit.png","system":{"description":"<p>Spirit first carried you beyond, and ever since part of you has remained on the threshold.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Spirit rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Spirit works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Spirit effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><ul><li>When you suffer Stains, you are <strong>always considered to have at least one active Conviction</strong>: you may still make the defense roll, and Aggravated damage requires the star result.</li><li>This does not apply when you violate one of your own Convictions.</li></ul><h3>Wisdom</h3><p>You <strong>heal Superficial Stains without assistance</strong>: remove <strong>1 at the beginning of each session</strong>.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-spirit","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"49"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-spirit"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"spirit","intro":"Spirit first carried you beyond, and ever since part of you has remained on the threshold.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Spirit rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Spirit works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Spirit effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<ul><li>When you suffer Stains, you are <strong>always considered to have at least one active Conviction</strong>: you may still make the defense roll, and Aggravated damage requires the star result.</li><li>This does not apply when you violate one of your own Convictions.</li></ul>"},{"id":"wisdom","label":"Wisdom","kind":"track","description":"<p>You <strong>heal Superficial Stains without assistance</strong>: remove <strong>1 at the beginning of each session</strong>.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereSpir01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
{"name":"Time","type":"feature","img":"modules/wod5e-mage/assets/icons/sheet/time.png","system":{"description":"<p>Time first told you that it was flowing, and you already knew it at twelve without having the words.</p><h3>Perception</h3><ul><li>Your level 1 Time rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Time works alone.</li></ul><h3>Resistance</h3><p>Resist Time effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p><h3>Innate Defense</h3><p>You cannot be caught off guard, <strong>you always act first</strong>, and your <strong>guard is never halved</strong> while weaving: you have already seen the blow coming.</p><h3>Duration</h3><p>When <strong>Time</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Duration</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Time rating and the Scope level, and Duration does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>","bonuses":[],"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-time","source":{"book":"M5 - Sphere Specialities","page":"56"},"points":0,"featuretype":"background"},"flags":{"wod5e":{"dataItemId":"mage-affinity-sphere-time"},"wod5e-mage":{"affinitySphere":{"id":"time","intro":"Time first told you that it was flowing, and you already knew it at twelve without having the words.","abilities":[{"id":"perception","label":"Perception","description":"<ul><li>Your level 1 Time rolls gain <strong>+2 dice</strong>, and maintaining a perception effect <strong>does not use your concentration slot</strong>.</li><li>This applies only while Time works alone.</li></ul>"},{"id":"resistance","label":"Resistance","description":"<p>Resist Time effects by rolling <strong>Arete plus an Attribute</strong> chosen by the Storyteller.</p>"},{"id":"innateDefense","label":"Innate Defense","description":"<p>You cannot be caught off guard, <strong>you always act first</strong>, and your <strong>guard is never halved</strong> while weaving: you have already seen the blow coming.</p>"},{"id":"duration","label":"Duration","kind":"scope","description":"<p>When <strong>Time</strong> is part of the roll, the <strong>Duration</strong> level you declare counts as the <strong>lower</strong> of your Time rating and the Scope level, and Duration does not weigh as an extra Scope in the threshold.</p>"}]}}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"_id":"MageSphereTime01","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0}}
